          "message": {
            "text": "PATCH /api/notes/:id merges the request body into the row with _.merge, letting any user overwrite and take ownership of another user's note. Severity high (likelihood high: Any self-registered user; one PATCH with {\"id\": <victim note id>, \"owner_id\": <own id>}; ids are sequential; impact high: Fully defeats the per-owner write check: overwrites another user's note title/body and moves it into the attacker's account)."
