            "text": "Needs validation: axios 0.21.0: a redirect from the previewed URL bypasses a configured egress proxy (CVE-2020-28168). Blockers: Is HTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY (or http_proxy / https_proxy) set in the production environment? axios 0.21.0 reads them in lib/adapters/http.js:99-145 when config.proxy is unset, and neither src/ nor .env.example sets them.; If a proxy is set, is it relied on to block internal and metadata addresses (169.254.169.254, RFC 1918)?. Validation plan: Run `printenv | grep -i _proxy` in the production runtime (or check the platform's env settings). If a proxy is set, from staging POST /api/preview with a URL on a host you control that 302-redirects to http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/ and check whether the proxy logs the second request. If no proxy is set, reject this record."
